# Strength half

This repo holds two halves. This chat owns **strength** only. Read `docs/ownership-halves.md` before editing.

- Branch: `cursor/strength-<short-task>` from an up-to-date `origin/main`.
- Lane check: `pnpm run verify:strength`.
- Full integration gate, including coach checks, remains `pnpm run verify`.
- Capgo channel for this half is `strength-live` / `com.hybrid.strength`. Do not publish unless the user explicitly authorizes that release.

## Owned paths

- `apps/shared/strength-targets.js`, `strength-equipment.js`, `strength-rts.js`, `strength-policy.js`, `strength-brain-core.js`, `training-core.js`
- `apps/athlete/` strength runtime: library, logger, session, strength-brain, strength-memory, release metadata
- `apps/mobile/capacitor/` when the change is the strength shell
- `checks/browser/` strength journeys

Edit canonical math under `apps/shared`, then run `node scripts/sync-training-core.mjs`.

## Engine half is out of bounds

Do not edit these in a strength branch:

- `packages/adaptive/**`
- `apps/athlete/conditioning/**`
- `apps/engine-web/**`
- `scripts/conditioning/**`

`pnpm run verify:engine` fails on a strength-only checkout. That failure means the engine tree is absent. It is not a strength regression.

## Shared files

Stop and report overlap before editing `supabase/`, `apps/athlete/hybrid-integrations.js`, `apps/athlete/plan-sync.js`, `apps/athlete/whoop-common.js`, or `apps/shared/whoop-common.js`. One half edits a shared file at a time.
